@startuml Sequence Diagram
title Juwan CTI v3.0 - Threat Analysis Sequence

box "Presentation" #LightBlue
  participant Dashboard
end box

box "Application Logic" #LightGreen
  participant "FastAPI (app.py)" as API
  participant "Ensemble (ensemble.py)" as Ensemble
end box

box "Detection Models" #Lavender
  participant "Email/Chat AI" as AI
  participant "Malware PE/YARA" as File
  participant "PCAP Scapy" as Traffic
end box

box "Persistence & Intel" #LightGray
  participant "PostgreSQL (IOCStore)" as DB
  participant "Celery (Clusterer)" as Worker
end box

== Phase 1: Data Submission ==
Dashboard -> API: POST /analyze/ensemble
API -> API: Validate Pydantic Schema

== Phase 2: Ensemble Dispatch ==
API -> Ensemble: get_decision(payload)
par Parallel Module Analysis
    Ensemble -> AI: analyze_text()
    Ensemble -> File: static_analyze()
    Ensemble -> Traffic: parse_pcap()
end

== Phase 3: Result Aggregation ==
AI -->> Ensemble: Phishing Prob (XGBoost)
File -->> Ensemble: Malware Prob (YARA)
Traffic -->> Ensemble: Anomaly Score (Scapy)

Ensemble -> Ensemble: Apply Weighted Formula\n(Threat Level Normalization)

== Phase 4: Forensic Logging ==
Ensemble -> DB: add_ioc_event(results)
DB -->> Ensemble: event_id

== Phase 5: Campaign Correlation (Async) ==
Worker -> DB: query_new_events()
Worker -> Worker: LSH MinHash Clustering
Worker -> DB: create_campaign_link()

== Phase 6: Result Visualization ==
Ensemble -->> API: Final Score + Indicator List
API -->> Dashboard: 200 OK (Phishing / HIGH)
Dashboard -> Dashboard: Render Glassmorphism Alert
@enduml
